# Build-context hygiene for the Beacon image: send only what the image needs.
# Version control, editor and Python caches
.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
# local environment files and anything secret-shaped never enter an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
# lab paperwork stays on the host
evidence
notes
*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
